  "description": "Input of extraction/generate_provenance.py. semantic = taxonomy: {id, category}. id is the information-architecture section id (ia.json at the project root, when present, is cross-checked); category is one of the closed semanticCategories. source = provenance of the implementing code; by default the generator takes the first src/ citation of the contract (a range that verify_all.py already resolves against the real file) and adds the rendered root tag from extraction/measured-values.json; an explicit source.id names JSX fragments that are not whole functions and an override pins a narrower file/lines/anchor. retrievalEligible lists the pinned retrieval-ineligible sections with their reasons.",
